    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost at Birth</strong> will tell the story of a rather ordinary guy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stable job, nice house, comfortable routine, married.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short, his life is pleasantly boring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To spice things up he has some fun on the side that his wife doesn't need to know about. Then things turn upside-down when a young woman comes into his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424810/extras/4fc57962e86dd4f908b185d7b0957170.avif?t=1752813390\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a choice-driven adult Visual Novel featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Over 2100 static images and several animated scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2-3 hours of game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Top notch graphic fidelity and realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover a variety of characters with different and interesting personalities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A realistic and interesting story that explores complex relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose how the mc acts selecting your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Music that adjusts to the scene's mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424810/extras/250e0e5e25884f19b1d1a6d49c0ee33f.avif?t=1752813390\" /></span>Pursue or change your relationship with the new people in your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424810/extras/662dfc40fcf4c0e241c65db09b98c9cb.avif?t=1752813390\" /></span>Try to stop your sex addiction and save your marriage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424810/extras/1dd1ab49fcd96ceed94a09ae247c7fb9.avif?t=1752813390\" /></span>Forget about all the people in your past and fall into a life of sex and hedonism.</p>",
